Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:13.20,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,The military swarmed into this city, which had lost its priest and had fallen into disorder,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:16.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and attacked the citizens here, \Ntrying to gain control militarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:20.28,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,You were the one who created the opportunity for them to do that, were you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:30.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The people of Liore are ethnically very similar to Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:31.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The folks at Central
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:35.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,must not have thought of them as being the same kind of people as themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:37.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am going to complete \Nthe Philosopher's Stone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:44.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for the sake of all people \Nwho suffer under tyranny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:45.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.37,0:00:47.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:18.14,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,This one is on a whole other level \Ncompared with the ones Tucker was creating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this the legacy of \Nthe 5th Laboratory?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.47,0:01:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of these things were known to you \Nand Colonel Archer, weren't they, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:31.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you guys hiding? We've had enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:32.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.66,0:01:39.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major Armstrong doesn't have anything to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm{\i0} the one who was \Nharboring Martel-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.40,0:01:44.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about, \NAlphonse-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:47.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is something that \NI've come to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:49.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't say anything \Nabout it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:52.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but please, everyone, \Nno more fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.33,0:01:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major, I know that you're trying to carry on where Hughes left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:15.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"You can just make your way to the top without having to know about anything."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:18.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"I will investigate what's happening behind the scenes myself."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.67,0:02:20.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.02,0:02:27.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry. \NRight now, I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.31,0:02:36.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:37.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:39.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, listen to me, and tell Ed, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever, just get inside me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:47.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:48.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san, what on earth is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liore is going to be \Nturned into another Ishbal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:52.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.11,0:02:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That man—the Führer—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:57.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is a homunculus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.77,0:04:42.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The military wants to \Nhave a just cause!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:46.83,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,That cause being that ultimately, the town of Liore \Nwas the one who first attacked the military,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.83,0:04:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and thus they had no choice but to massacre us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:05:00.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lure the military in \Nwithout offering resistance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:02.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When that happens, the wrath of God \Nwill rain down upon them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:16.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's pretty bad taste to prop up \Na mute woman as a holy mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.12,0:05:19.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose-san is the one \Nwho gave us courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:21.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's the one who told us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:25.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that we can stand under our own power, not by the god Leto, or the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:28.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all the same if it means you're still following somebody else, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.51,0:05:29.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.84,0:05:43.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can't help it. \NWe humans are so weak, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.23,0:05:48.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lyra, is that perfume?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:54.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I haven't had \Na chance to bathe, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't like that smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:01.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind that, \Nwhat are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That should be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think I can turn a blind eye to what Scar is doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:07.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:10.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, there are going to be casualties among the townspeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:12.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He says he's going to use the inbound military
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:16.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as ingredients to transmute his Philosopher's Stone. But if that fails...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.20,0:06:21.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And here I thought that \Nmaybe you admired Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:25.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We both feel the same way about wanting to protect the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.35,0:06:29.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lyra, I need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:31.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, I need you to hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:44.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Alphonse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:49.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He came from Liore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He brought a letter \Naddressed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:54.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's from Brother? \NThen he's safe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.63,0:06:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. According to Ed-kun's letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.59,0:07:00.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar has turned the whole town into a transmutation circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:03.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He also says that by no means are we to enter the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.06,0:07:06.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they're planning
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.35,0:07:09.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to lure the military in and use them as ingredients for the Philosopher's Stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The ingredients for a \NPhilosopher's Stone are live humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.57,0:07:22.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And a very large \Nnumber of them, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.43,0:07:28.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.25,0:07:32.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's the truth behind the 5th Laboratory, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:35.76,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Then the higher-ups within the military were sanctioning human experimentation...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:39.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, you're heading to Liore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:41.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they're together, \Nyou should meet up with Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:43.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we leave them alone, \NLiore will surrender in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:50.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arresting Scar after that happens will be good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.78,0:07:52.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:53.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:58.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Ed-kun's. \NThe Major just returned it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:24.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fools, who defy the military,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:26.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,away with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.19,0:08:32.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Animals that can talk? \NYou must be confused!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:35.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chimeras. It's them, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:38.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more, they said \Nthere was a man who could
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:40.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,suddenly create explosions with just his touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:41.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:43.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.68,0:08:47.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those guys are just a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The main enemy forces will \Ndefinitely be invading afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:55.06,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,As planned, we will draw them into the city, \Nwithout offering any resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:57.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before that happens, you're going to escape through that passageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:04.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am going to go dispose of the enemy, who has come here as a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.05,0:09:12.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have an obligation to \Nmake sure they get away safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:18.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:28.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Rose, Lyra.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:30.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're being a pretty \Ngood loser, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:34.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that letter has arrived, then the military won't be coming in for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:37.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Scar can't get the ingredients for his Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:38.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then nothing is going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.34,0:09:43.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:46.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is get you away to someplace \Nwhere the military can't reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.68,0:09:50.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liore is going to fall under military command.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you have to blame someone, \Nblame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.07,0:09:59.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't overturn \Nthe military's decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.93,0:10:26.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:28.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seven thousand troops total, \Nall gathered together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:32.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would be possible for us to crush Liore right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:39.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Table the attack for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:40.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.27,0:10:43.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to the letter that Colonel Mustang received,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:46.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the Fullmetal Alchemist appears to still be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.05,0:10:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liore may be preparing for a dialogue between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no possibility of that now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:58.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, we cannot very well \Ninvade the city without just cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.62,0:11:01.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pride,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.88,0:11:04.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what do you mean, \Ndelaying the assault?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:07.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have some complaint, Lust?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.10,0:11:10.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar is lying in wait \Nfor the military to invade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:15.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He intends to use those lives to \Ntransmute the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.03,0:11:17.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So why don't you send \Nthe military in right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.23,0:11:18.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am under orders \Nfrom you-know-who.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:23.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I do not know \Nwhat is being considered,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:25.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but that person's word is absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:27.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.44,0:11:30.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.47,0:11:32.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Scar is going to create a Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then I am going to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.81,0:11:39.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't embrace any wasted feelings for Scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:43.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are allowed to live \Nbecause of that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.31,0:11:44.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:46.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is precisely the reason
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,why we have been seeking the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:53.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am going to Liore once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:56.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get the military moving as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.44,0:11:59.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gluttony?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:02.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... you-know-who said...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.35,0:12:11.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is fleeing all you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.37,0:12:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Ishbalans, who had the \Nsame color of skin that you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:17.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,were a bit more \Nchallenging than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:23.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I was expecting too much from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.31,0:12:26.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all that we've done, I thought \Nthey would be fighting back by now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:28.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I guess we haven't killed enough of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.16,0:12:49.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, it {\i1}is{\i0} you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:50.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crimson Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.24,0:12:53.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:56.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.45,0:13:00.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That scar is one of \Nmy best works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:04.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with your right arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:08.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of all the State Alchemists \Nwhom I kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.49,0:13:10.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you will be the last!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.69,0:13:24.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:35.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That right arm... I get it. \NIt's just like that one time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.45,0:13:37.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,when my red stone was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:43.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Feed me as many as you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:46.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will take that cursed red light...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.57,0:13:51.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and transmute it into a \NPhilosopher's Stone within me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.22,0:13:58.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to \Nleave the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:13:59.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:02.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! This is the will \Nof the Holy Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:07.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose, what will you do if Scar-san \Ndoes not come, even after we've fled?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.13,0:14:11.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without the Philosopher's Stone, \Nwe cannot fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:12.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, Lyra.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:14.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll negotiate with the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.63,0:14:15.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somehow or other...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.90,0:14:17.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't put any trust into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.76,0:14:20.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We all have to split up and run away in all directions right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:22.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, make our appeals from cities all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.31,0:14:25.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone \Nwhat happened in Liore,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.33,0:14:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what happened in Ishbal in the past, and of the tyranny of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll just become another story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:34.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yet another city tried to create a Philosopher's Stone and was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.41,0:14:50.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose, Lyra, you guys \Nget out of here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:14:59.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the rest of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:08.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're... Sensei's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:10.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:15.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Call me Wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:30.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose! You idiot, stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:46.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:50.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.59,0:15:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:55.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just being used by Scar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:56.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to die for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:15:58.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.60,0:16:15.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you guys' weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:17.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:19.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you guys come in contact
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:22.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with the bones or other remains of \Nthe one whose human transmutation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:24.75,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,was the subject of an attempt at reanimation, \Nyou become unable to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are impostors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.74,0:16:31.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why you cower \Nwhen faced with the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, \NI don't have a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.45,0:16:39.10,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I was transmuted with the remains of my own body as ingredients, after I was stillborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.34,0:16:44.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My real body is \Nnowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.95,0:16:47.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if it were,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it would be your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.13,0:16:58.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:05.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to where \Nall the others went!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:06.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:34.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure \Nyou want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:38.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While you're chasing me around, \Nthe military could be on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:42.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am going to at least avenge my brother \Nfor what you did to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.73,0:17:45.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What foolishness. \NThis is a fight over vengeance?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:48.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what is in this for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:49.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:51.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:53.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You killed that many of the \NIshbalan people for nothing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:55.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To put it my own way,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:59.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you alter a person just a little bit, \Nthey become nothing more than a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:02.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humans aren't all that great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.44,0:18:06.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You, me—we're all just \Nmeaningless things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.80,0:18:10.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're all hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.73,0:18:12.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I might indeed be hollow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.31,0:18:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I am not meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:28.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I said, Alphonse Elric,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.11,0:18:31.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am a State Alchemist, \Njust like your brother is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.53,0:18:34.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're nothing more \Nthan a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:37.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san, please stop too. Where is my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:39.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stand aside, Alphonse Elric!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:43.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There has been \Nenough bloodshed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:51.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you put an end \Nto this now, Scar-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:10.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.03,0:19:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your arm has been \Nsuperbly transmuted!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you hear that? \NThe countdown to your death?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.47,0:19:22.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your arm is slowly combining with \Nthe oxygen in the air, and before long...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:30.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look closely, and see \Nwhether or not I am hollow...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:36.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is what a real person looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.79,0:19:53.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:58.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.28,0:20:01.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will do what you two could not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:17.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are red stones \Ndoing in his silver watch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:19.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made a promise, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:22.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That I was going to \Nblow you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.20,0:20:26.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.49,0:20:29.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, you feel so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:32.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should make for...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:34.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a magnificent bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:43.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... You're the Führer's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:44.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:49.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you make me right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.57,0:21:01.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E...d...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:17.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me back my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.08,0:21:20.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:29.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up... Stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make that thing shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:35.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up... Shut up...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.66,0:21:46.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get up... and walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:48.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.49,0:21:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move... forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.47,0:21:53.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:57.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.35,0:23:40.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.11,0:23:43.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 42: "His Name Is Unknown"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:47.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.87,0:23:50.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this a Philosopher's Stone?
